<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Consideratio=
ns:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I'm very conscious about <strong=
>when and why components re-render</strong>. My approach:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memoization Strategy</s=
trong>: useMemo for expensive calculations, useCallback for functions passe=
d to children, React.memo for components with stable props</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Context Optimization</s=
trong>: Split contexts by update frequency - fast-changing UI state separat=
e from slow-changing user data</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>State Colocation</stron=
g>: Keep state as close to where it's used as possible</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Testing Philosophy:</str=
ong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I write tests that <strong>focus=
 on user behavior rather than implementation details</strong>:</p>
