<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Testing Principles:<=
/strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Test Behavior, Not Impl=
ementation</strong>: Focus on what users can/cannot do rather than internal=
 state</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cover Edge Cases</stron=
g>: Malformed data, network failures, race conditions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Testing</st=
rong>: Ensure system scales with complex permission sets</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Real-world Scenarios</s=
trong>: Test inheritance, real-time updates, and component lifecycles</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Accessibility</strong>:=
 Ensure error states and fallbacks are accessible</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This comprehensive testing appro=
ach ensures the permission system is <strong>robust, performant, and mainta=
inable</strong> in production environments like Webflow's complex editor in=
terface.</p>
