<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Benefits of This App=
roach:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Type Safety</strong>: C=
ompile-time checking for most operations</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Runtime Validation</str=
ong>: Graceful handling of dynamic content</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Extensibility</strong>:=
 Easy to add new element types and operations</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance</strong>: T=
ypeScript optimizations + minimal runtime overhead</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Developer Experience</s=
trong>: Great intellisense and error messages</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Trade-offs:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Initial Setup Complexit=
y</strong>: More upfront work to define types</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bundle Size</strong>: R=
untime validation schemas add some weight</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Learning Curve</strong>=
: Team needs to understand the type system</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">But in my experience, this inves=
tment pays off <strong>enormously</strong> in maintainability and developer=
 productivity, especially in complex applications like Webflow where the ty=
pe system needs to evolve with user needs.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ex=
cellent! Your approach to handling dynamic types while maintaining safety i=
s very sophisticated. This brings me to my next question about performance.=
 At Webflow, users can create very complex sites with hundreds or thousands=
 of elements, real-time collaboration, and heavy visual effects. How do you=
 approach performance optimization in React applications at this scale?</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Perf=
ormance at scale is absolutely critical, especially in creative tools where=
 <strong>any lag breaks the creative flow</strong>. I approach this systema=
tically across multiple dimensions:</p>
